<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:16px;color:#374151;">Dear {{hodName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;">
  A complaint in your department has been reopened <strong>{{reopenCount}} times</strong> and requires your review:
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;">
  <span style="display:inline-block;background-color:#fee2e2;color:#991b1b;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:6px;letter-spacing:1px;">{{ticketCode}}</span>
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:14px;color:#6b7280;"><strong>Subject:</strong> {{subject}}</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;color:#991b1b;">
  Repeated reopening indicates the resolution may not be addressing the citizen's concern. Please review the investigation and consider a revised approach.
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;text-align:center;">
  <a href="{{reviewUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;background-color:#0f766e;color:#ffffff;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;padding:12px 28px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;">Review Complaint</a>
</p>
